      "side": 1,
      "message": "The check further below already enforces that a localNetworkConfig must be provided if the local capability is provided, could that be enough ?\nOtherwise there\u0027s a bit inconsistent behavior where if you set the local capability you have to provide a localNetworkConfig, *except* if you set skipNativeNetworkCreation",
      "revId": "9638cc4f6fd3ab6db633bee0b8f63851dc199c80",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "099e7336_9d7946a2",
        "filename": "service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
